# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows(CRLF) 与 prettier(lf)
# 反复产生全库 diff 和数千条 prettier/prettier 警告
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
